      "summary_html": "<p>Spawn\u2019s ten-person team shipped 77,000 code changes in a month with an always-on fleet of AI agents. NLW breaks down the systems behind that output, why human taste and ambition still matter, and five practical lessons other businesses can apply. In the headlines: legal AI startup Crosby bids for Weil\u2019s assets, tech stocks slide despite surging AI revenues, and Granola launches free dictation.</p><p><strong>Listen to the new How We Got Here with NLW: </strong></p><p><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-we-got-here-with-nlw/id6822359990\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-we-got-here-with-nlw/id6822359990\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/7h55KSq0XwIjdWzwF2zgNV?si=cb76360051ec48a0\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://open.spotify.com/show/7h55KSq0XwIjdWzwF2zgNV?si=cb76360051ec48a0\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Learn More about the AI Champions Program: </strong><a href=\"https://www.besuper.ai/champions\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://www.besuper.ai/champions\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Brought to you by:</strong></p><p><strong>KPMG</strong> \u2013 New KPMG and UT Austin research shows what separates \u201cAI Amplifiers\u201d from everyone else. Learn more at <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/us/en/articles/2026/ai-redefining-career-success-empower-your-talent-thrive.html?utm_source=the_ai_daily_brief&amp;utm_medium=native&amp;utm_content=podcast&amp;utm_campaign=701dV00000aMKrPQAW&amp;cid=701dV00000aMKrPQAW\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060kpmg.com/us/AIamplifiers\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Granola</strong> - The AI notepad for people in back-to-back meetings. Try it free <a href=\"http://granola